# These patterns follow .gitignore rules, so a pattern that CONTAINS A SLASH is anchored to the
# directory holding this file - config/ - and not to the repository root. Every such pattern
# therefore starts with `../`. A pattern without a slash, like package-lock.json below, matches at
# any depth and is left unanchored.

